  "title": "Chart alternatives & previews: where implemented and what to touch for a new display",
  "kind": "cochange",
  "answers": [
    "Where are chart alternatives/previews implemented?",
    "How do I add a new trends chart display?",
    "How are gallery previews built?"
  ],
  "body": "Dir: products/product_analytics/frontend/insights/chartAlternatives/.\n- ChartAlternatives.tsx mounts chartAlternativesLogic + chartPreviewsLogic; falls back to ChartFilter if !canShowAlternatives; else popover with ChartGallery.\n- chartDisplayOptions.ts: option catalogue/eligibility (getChartDisplayOptions, applyChartDisplay).\n- chartRecommendations.ts:getChartAlternatives: up to 3 ranked suggestions.\n- chartPreviewsLogic.ts: one ChartPreview per option; previewVizNode = embedded InsightVizNode; real response or sample fallback.\n- chartPreviewData.ts:deriveChartPreview, RAW_TIME_SERIES_DISPLAYS; chartPreviewSamples.ts synthesizes rows (world map, calendar heatmap, box plot).\n- ChartPreviewCanvas.tsx re-mounts logic stack, renders TrendInsight with PREVIEW_CONTEXT {hideAxes:true}.\nNew trends display: edit Trends.tsx (component), chartDisplayOptions.ts (option+eligibility), chartRecommendations.ts (if suggested), chartPreviewSamples/Data (if synthetic data needed).",
  "applies": "Trends chart displays; other insight types don't use ChartAlternatives gallery the same way.",
